<title>USA: LaserSight gets CD Mark certification.</title>
<headline>LaserSight gets CD Mark certification.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaserSight Inc said Friday its LaserSight Technologies Inc subsidiary is now certified to apply the CE Mark to its LaserScan 2000 excimer laser.</p>
<p>CE Mark is the quality assurance certification requirement recognized by members of the European Community for sales into those countries.</p>
<p>The company said meeting the CE Mark requirements allows LaserSight to expand European sales of the excimer laser into Germany, France, Switzerland and Austria.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
